==Chapters==
* ''[[ET02|Play Misty For Me]]''

==Important events==
* Ash is revealed to have captured a Caterpie and a {{TP|Ash|Pidgeotto}}.
* Ash wins the {{badge|Boulder}}.
* Ash's Caterpie evolves into Metapod.
* Ash's Metapod evolves into {{TP|Ash|Butterfree}}.
* Ash wins the {{badge|Cascade}}.

==Translation edits==
[[File:ET02 monthly volume comparison.png|thumb|right|Misty's top in the monthly (left) and volume (right) releases]]
While much of the revealing clothing in this chapter was edited out before its release in English, further differences occur between the English monthly and collected volume releases. In this release, Misty is wearing the same white top as in the Japanese version as well as in ''[[ET01|Pikachu, I See You!]]'' - a white top revealing some cleavage. In the [[Electric Tale of Pikachu volume 1|collected volume]], however, her top is re-drawn as a black top with no cleavage revealed.

